 winter service","notes":"Reserve a campus service when bookings open, or use the livestream or regional-tour listings when Greene Chapel seats are unavailable.","short_summary":"Choir, scripture lessons, and handheld candles transform Greene Chapel during Hendrix’s winter observance.","evidence_claim":"Hendrix describes Candlelight Carol Services as a tradition spanning more than six decades, modeled on the Festival of Nine Lessons and Carols and performed by the College Choir.","source_url":"https://www.hendrix.edu/Hendrix-College-Choir-Candlelight-Carol-Services-Set/","source_title":"Hendrix College Choir Candlelight Carol Services Set for Dec. 4-7, 17-18; Tour Stops in Russellville, Little Rock","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Dates change annually, and Greene Chapel performances may require reservations; verify the current Candlelight page before attending.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"hendrix-new-student-convocation","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"New Student Convocation","title":"Receive the Formal Hendrix Welcome","subtitle":"Orientation’s class-and-family convocation","notes":"New students should follow the Orientation schedule to the listed venue; families and supporters are expressly invited to share the formal welcome.","short_summary":"The incoming class begins its Hendrix story together at a formal campus ceremony.","evidence_claim":"Hendrix’s 2025 orientation schedule explicitly calls New Student Convocation a campus tradition serving as the formal welcome for the incoming class and families.","source_url":"https://www.hendrix.edu/uploadedFiles/Orientation/Move-in%20Day%20Schedule%202-page%202025%20%285%29.pdf","source_title":"Hendrix College Class of ’29 Orientation: Move-in Day Schedule","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"202